  triage:title "AI.36 required structural source-scan gate for receiver record writer/unlink is absent" ;
  triage:description "crates/atm-architecture/tests/boundary_enforcement.rs contains only Cargo dependency-edge checks; no AST/source-text scan enforces the sprint doc sub-task 3 requirement that the endpoint record is written only by GraftReceiverListener and receiver ownership is not reimplemented in the Python bridge (docs/plans/phase-ai/sprint-ai-36-graft-receiver-ownership.md sub-task 3, required tests, lines 146-147: 'a source scan rejects a second record publisher or direct record unlink outside the owner implementation'). The invariant currently holds by inspection only and is unenforced against regression." ;
