  triage:blockingCurrentMerge false ;
  triage:note "Missing structural test gate in boundary_enforcement.rs; AI.36 sprint sub-task 3 requirement not implemented. Remediation: add a structural/source-scan test failing the build if any file outside GraftReceiverListener writes/unlinks a receiver record, with explicit atm-graft-python coverage. FIXED on fix/ai36-qa-repair@9cf129e6: crates/atm-architecture/tests/graft_receiver_ownership_boundary.rs adds receiver_record_publication_and_unlink_stay_in_the_listener_owner, a source-text scan asserting write_receiver_record/fs::remove_file(&self.record_path) occurrence counts in graft.rs and confirming crates/atm-graft-python/src/lib.rs never publishes/unlinks the record directly. Verified passing via `cargo test -p atm-architecture --test graft_receiver_ownership_boundary` (1 passed). Note: AI36-QA-2's arch-qa and ruthless-boundary-qa reviewers both reported this as still-missing — that was stale/incomplete evidence (they only grepped boundary_enforcement.rs and missed this separate test file in the same tests/ directory)." ;
  triage:foundIn triage:AI36-QA-1 ;
